      "notes": "Imported pre-CKD MG4 EV, priced in June 2023 at Rp649.9 jt (Moladin: OTR Jakarta; Zigwheels says off-the-road) with deliveries from July 2023; detik (Oct 2023) still quotes 'from Rp649 jutaan' OTR Jakarta. Replaced by the CKD Magnify at Rp433 jt in January 2024 (see 2024+ records). Assembly origin of these early units not stated, so left out. Moladin's '125 PS' is taken as a typo for detik's 125 kW. Ignite has ABS/EBD/EBA, stability and traction control, hill start assist and auto hold but not the i-Smart ADAS (BSD, RCTA, DOW, RCW, LDW, ACC) of the Magnify i-Smart. The Magnify i-Smart was also offered in 2023 but no price was found. Free service: Moladin 4 yrs/50,000 km, Zigwheels 5 yrs, so left out. Fast charge 10–80% 35 min (charger power not stated). Range test standard not stated in 2023 sources. Kerb weight (listed as weight), boot capacity and top speed from the Malaysian spec of the 51 kWh, 168 hp RWD MG4 Standard (paultan.org).",
